Hello Antonio,

thank you very much for your detailed explaination! I think the reason for my "anti-pattern" was that I failed to realize a mapreduce job could have an output even without the reduce phase. Now everything is working fine for me and the java heap size is also not troubling me anymore :)

Best regards!

On Thursday, November 14, 2013 7:35:13 PM UTC+1, Antonio Piccolboni wrote:

> On Thu, Nov 14, 2013 at 10:00 AM, Tuyki <yinchon...@gmail.com> wrote:

> > Hello Antonio,
> >
